{"name": "Dark Side Void", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Dark Side Void\" is a game where you control mechs to fight against various enemies. In a 2D side-scrolling environment, shooting and melee combat will bring a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/0f9fb868c3ae70bc30447b1b35244556.poster.avif?t=1790855610\" width=\"564\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/0f9fb868c3ae70bc30447b1b35244556.webm?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/0f9fb868c3ae70bc30447b1b35244556.mp4?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Speed \u200b\u200bCombat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience high-speed maneuvering combat in a space environment; skillful maneuvering will create advantageous situations in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/37bb08f5b577124f689dad3ee5fb0c35.poster.avif?t=1790855610\" width=\"564\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/37bb08f5b577124f689dad3ee5fb0c35.webm?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/37bb08f5b577124f689dad3ee5fb0c35.mp4?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A variety of mechs and equipment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can freely combine various weapons and equipment, and train different pilots. Players can equip various mechs to challenge different missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/24552e4d97aa21681065582ed6cf14ef.poster.avif?t=1790855610\" width=\"564\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/24552e4d97aa21681065582ed6cf14ef.webm?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/extras/24552e4d97aa21681065582ed6cf14ef.mp4?t=1790855610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various Enemy Types</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a variety of dangerous enemies, numerous in number, massive in size, and possessing powerful firepower, posing a challenge to the pilot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dark Side Void is a 2D side-scrolling mecha action game set in space. Scarred by devastating interstellar wars, the Solar System is riddled with hidden dangers across its cosmic frontiers. Pilot your fully armed combat mech and embark on a cosmic journey packed with fierce mecha battles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4770970/6cea4dff2a0d414b3be0090e8f1fe6f7b9b4307d/header.jpg?t=1790855610", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Mechs", "Bullet Hell", "Action", "Robots", "Space", "Sci-fi"], "developers": "Beyond The Light Cone", "publishers": "Beyond The Light Cone", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4770970", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/OiYCWDM6hvg", "first_seen": 1790805600.0, "review_rank": 31}